: "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15afff985f64522f15203a05bfbd677ef201bc75", "message": ".", "created_at": "2026-01-22T19:55:11Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "47fcda540c5511e59624d342447952011ef4f7f6", "message": "Revert \"Fix header spacing consistency across all pages\"\n\nThis reverts commit 7f8111752a26211a6ae09f43aa2745fa6ed7ffc0.", "created_at": "2026-01-14T01:30:12Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f8111752a26211a6ae09f43aa2745fa6ed7ffc0", "message": "Fix header spacing consistency across all pages\n\nSimplified CSS selector to target .header_area directly instead of\ncomplex sibling selectors that didn't work due to varying HTML structure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:46:04Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4239698f047b2d9c7e61c6491a0814b1ff50ef66", "message": "Apply header negative margin only on desktop (min-width 992px)\n\nPrevents menu overlap with logo on small windows\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:42:59Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7396073526fa15e49468f04be04b653fccdf6b31", "message": "Fix desktop spacing and mobile logo size\n\n- Add negative margin to header to reduce gap after logo on desktop\n- Reduce mobile logo from 50%/70% to 40% with max-width caps (200px/180px)\n- Make touch device selectors more specific (img.class)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:42:06Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a49e07c64e2820a936b4e8f39e8d363afcc8520", "message": "Remove all margin/padding from logo except left alignment\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:39:50Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ff4dcaa8cc32369afb4a4156bbac07f83f02086", "message": "Remove bottom padding from logo to reduce desktop spacing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:38:41Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "99a28713b23c5a4a41e4cb2a4a77f15cb62237eb", "message": "Left-justify all logos on desktop and mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:36:59Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "73f80a87cb0e933c515e717f9d633551eea59d92", "message": "Fix logo centering on desktop and sizing on mobile\n\n- Use explicit margin-left/right auto for centering\n- Add max-width constraint for mobile (250px)\n- Use !important to override conflicting styles on touch devices\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:35:48Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f0f3a2935496cb597218b7ba88ca6e405f408e4a", "message": "Ensure logo displays properly on touch devices\n\nAdded explicit styles for .index-logo and .subpage-logo in touch device media query\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:33:20Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0192e034e910b860942addda4141c71e0140b689", "message": "Make logo and nav consistent across all pages\n\n- Move logo above header on all subpages (matching index layout)\n- Unify logo CSS (.index-logo and .subpage-logo share same styles)\n- Add dynamic nav link font scaling script to all pages\n- Remove embedded nav-logo from navigation on subpages\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:14:37Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77e4d8c12ddc6501d5dc8e3d85311cbcb885290c", "message": "Match link headings size to year subheadings on publications/conferences\n\nBoth .contentsmallheader and .pub-year now use same font size and weight\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:07:40Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8be32022b9c31136a919e41a9aaaa1c7ddea89a4", "message": "Fix conference presentations text scaling to match year headings\n\nChanged from relative 0.75em to fixed pixels with responsive breakpoints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:03:23Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "00e7d06307e343d4c7e0da108de0bd94932a4715", "message": "Add page-specific titles and meta descriptions, remove resources page\n\n- Add unique titles for each page (e.g., \"Research | Arcaro Lab\")\n- Add SEO meta descriptions for all pages\n- Delete unused resources.html placeholder\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T23:01:17Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b6b1e09d55e79102e7fa4e80121347e54e8bc233", "message": "Fix publications page spacing with negative margin\n\nPulls publications container up to reduce gap after red bar\nwithout affecting other pages\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T22:38:09Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3a7c2062276e357a963de88f17e9c8c2f9ca232", "message": "Reduce top padding on publications container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T22:35:28Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "29ca335c8fca901782ec53766125a383c61df072", "message": "Add touch-device specific styles for mobile menu\n\n- Use @media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) to target actual touch devices\n- Reset percentage margins that cause issues on mobile\n- Clean vertical menu with fixed padding and no overlap\n- Hide nav logo on mobile to save space\n- Add hover/active states for touch menu items\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T22:33:28Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dd7cc3a10f066fa2d0340790d5a2481fa3facddf", "message": ".", "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:59:36Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97a5c37ce46aed00e9db83fd12a7781fcefb3d1c", "message": "Fix menu spacing for desktop and mobile\n\n- Apply negative margin only on desktop (992px+) to reduce nav-to-content gap\n- Use proportional spacing (em units, line-height) for mobile dropdown menu\n- Menu item spacing now scales with text size across all displays\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:59:09Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "81464495647755932160e7295ff4a932fa6b3cab", "message": "Fix HTML issues, add consistent styling, and update research content\n\n- Fix unclosed div tags on publications and conferences pages\n- Add missing </html> tags across multiple pages\n- Add alt text for accessibility on images\n- Make footers consistent across all pages\n- Fix mobile menu dropdown overlap\n- Update research page with new themes (Architecture, Development, Evolution)\n- Add CSS for publications, contact, and research page layouts\n- Reduce footer link spacing\n- Increase publications/conferences text size and container width\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:54:24Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fab9be8e0b331db90232891b36097613969bbe0a", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:40:25Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a5ddd05e755da5b1deed24a64c078c7b9fd12405", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:30:32Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8f0764984122a61194b850e668490a74807cf2e0", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:51:22Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef3632b0ca1ea4c78e15c9e034550402e634f4c3", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-29T19:31:31Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c39ed2cc62d35f57db7174e9df15e8f8bfc7f901", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:13:12Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "363e70c035aaefbd8734a2d12a339ae4bc71a787", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:16:45Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7643c6d0ff7faea98d360c4b0461d9c14fd0598", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:28:48Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5a458ff9d48af6b9f6e4638277d9c1355cb8032", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-19T01:55:45Z", "repo": "arcarolab", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bca14385afebe33315d266620558dd3e20b7c0e8", "message": ".", "created_at": "2025-09-